            "review_title": "Review at Bornga -Original Korean Taste-",
            "review_text": "JAEHYUN BAHK\nDaegu, South Korea95 contributions\n0\nThe most popular traditional korean restaurant in hichiminh city\nDec 2022 • Solo\nThe most popular traditional korean restaurant in hochiminh.\n\nAll staffs are kind and expert.\n\nThey speak English and Korean, absolutely Vietnamese.\n\nIf you don't know about Korean cuisines \nJust pick the picture on menu.\n\nPersonally, I recommend \"u-sam-keop\" combo menu which is made of beef(U means cow and sam-keop mean triple stored meat with fat and meat)\n\nThey set the table many kinds of vegetables and fresh meat, meat sources.\nRead more\nWritten December 7, 2022",
