            "review_title": "Review at Bornga -Original Korean Taste-",
            "review_text": "Shankar2526\nbirmingham55 contributions\n0\nFantastic first experience.\nOct 2022 • Couples\nCannot recommend this place highly enough. After a long day touring co chi tunnels and delta decided to get a quick bite. This Korean BBQ looked interesting as my wife and I had not done BBQ before so went in. We explained we did not know how it all worked. Alongside the meat to be grilled they set out a cornucopia of kimchi, vegetables and rice (approx 12 items.) When we made mistake of finishing off one dish it would be replaced with more. The hostess also grilled the meat for us and showed how to wrap on lettuce leaves to be eaten. Fantastic first experience of BBQ. We will certainly be back when we are in HCM again.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 15, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
