            "review_title": "Review at Bornga -Original Korean Taste-",
            "review_text": "Deso23\nHong Kong, China3369 contributions\n0\nAll within expectation from this Korean chain, nice meal!\nJan 2020\nA good Korean BBQ joint where u will find more selection of authentic kimchi than the usual Korean BBQ... together with the signature long vegetable plate for you to wrap the BBQ meat... also a good selection of meat and seafood with generous portion... reasonable price for tourist standards although not cheap compared to local index.... a good alternative if you have had enough pho, hu tieu or seafood in HCMC... a nice change from the local delicacies if you are staying in Saigon for an extended period!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 22, 2020",
