            "review_text": "CptWonderpants\nLisbon, Portugal257 contributions\n0\nBest banchan, clean & nice service\nJul 2019 • Couples\nWe had a great time at Bornga - it's the best Korean in D1 (I think), and the service is prompt and friendly. \n\nWe had kimchi jiigae, bibimbab, and pork belly. It game with a LOT of great banchan - very generous with the portion and variety. Nice selection of soju as well.\n\nOverall, it's easy here - it's clean and great for groups. It's comfortable and has a really easy, instructional menu for those less familiar with Korean cuisine. Will definitely be back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 13, 2019",
